WEBVTT

1
00:00:46.791 --> 00:00:48.208
In the previous verses,

2
00:00:48.208 --> 00:00:49.250
Lord Krishna explained

3
00:00:49.250 --> 00:00:52.958
how He sustains all of creation.

4
00:00:52.958 --> 00:00:54.416
Now in these verses,

5
00:00:54.416 --> 00:00:56.375
He reveals the secret of His role

6
00:00:56.375 --> 00:01:00.000
in the cycles of creation and dissolution

7
00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:02.083
of the entire universe.

8
00:01:07.041 --> 00:01:10.083
After night, the sun rises again.

9
00:01:10.083 --> 00:01:13.458
After autumn, spring returns.

10
00:01:13.458 --> 00:01:16.791
This is the ever-changing face of the world –

11
00:01:16.791 --> 00:01:20.125
a cycle of creation, expansion, and dissolution

12
00:01:20.125 --> 00:01:21.916
that never stops.

13
00:01:21.916 --> 00:01:25.000
In this verse, Lord Krishna says that creation

14
00:01:25.000 --> 00:01:27.625
begins from Him alone.

15
00:01:27.625 --> 00:01:30.416
At the end of a kalpa –

16
00:01:30.416 --> 00:01:34.208
all living beings and material elements
 dissolve back into His divine power.

17
00:01:34.208 --> 00:01:37.125
A kalpa meaning bhrama’s one day contains

18
00:01:37.125 --> 00:01:40.250
countless yugas within it.

19
00:01:40.250 --> 00:01:45.208
When that day ends, all of creation dissolves.

20
00:01:45.208 --> 00:01:46.375
But as soon as

21
00:01:46.375 --> 00:01:48.083
a new day begins,

22
00:01:48.083 --> 00:01:49.958
the entire universe is created once more

23
00:01:49.958 --> 00:01:53.875
by the will of Lord Krishna.

24
00:01:53.875 --> 00:01:55.333
However vast this process

25
00:01:55.333 --> 00:01:57.500
may seem to us,

26
00:01:57.500 --> 00:01:59.083
Lord Krishna remains completely

27
00:01:59.083 --> 00:02:00.875
unaffected by it.

28
00:02:00.875 --> 00:02:03.250
He is neither attached to it

29
00:02:03.250 --> 00:02:05.041
nor disturbed by it.

30
00:02:05.041 --> 00:02:09.458
He remains always free, steady, and eternal.

31
00:02:09.458 --> 00:02:12.666
It is like a painter

32
00:02:12.666 --> 00:02:16.083
who paints and erases again and again,

33
00:02:16.083 --> 00:02:18.833
yet the canvas never changes.

34
00:02:18.833 --> 00:02:22.083
Lord Krishna is that painter,

35
00:02:22.083 --> 00:02:24.791
this creation is His canvas,

36
00:02:24.791 --> 00:02:27.041
and the material world is the painting upon it.

37
00:02:27.041 --> 00:02:30.291
The cycle of creation and dissolution

38
00:02:30.291 --> 00:02:33.833
happens only by the command

39
00:02:33.833 --> 00:02:37.500
of Lord Krishna – the sustainer of all creation.

40
00:02:37.500 --> 00:02:39.833
This is what Lord Krishna tells us

41
00:02:39.833 --> 00:02:42.000
in the next verse, 9.8.

42
00:02:42.000 --> 00:02:42.875
He says –

43
00:02:42.875 --> 00:02:44.000
all of creation moves

44
00:02:44.000 --> 00:02:46.708
by My command alone.

45
00:02:46.708 --> 00:02:49.166
Every being and every thing

46
00:02:49.166 --> 00:02:51.500
is born by My will

47
00:02:51.500 --> 00:02:54.833
and ultimately dissolves back into Me.

48
00:02:54.833 --> 00:02:57.000
And yet, through all of this,

49
00:02:57.000 --> 00:02:59.708
Lord Krishna remains beyond
 the movements of creation –

50
00:02:59.708 --> 00:03:02.416
ever established in His divine form.

51
00:03:02.416 --> 00:03:05.250
When we accept this truth,

52
00:03:05.250 --> 00:03:08.750
we are inspired to rise above
 the instability of the material world

53
00:03:08.750 --> 00:03:12.416
and move toward that eternal truth –

54
00:03:12.416 --> 00:03:15.833
which never changes, never fades,

55
00:03:15.833 --> 00:03:17.125
which is timeless,

56
00:03:17.125 --> 00:03:20.916
indestructible, and forever steady.

57
00:03:20.916 --> 00:03:21.750
And when

58
00:03:21.750 --> 00:03:23.208
we establish our connection

59
00:03:23.208 --> 00:03:25.791
with Lord Krishna,

60
00:03:25.791 --> 00:03:29.000
that bond too becomes indestructible
 and steady –

61
00:03:29.000 --> 00:03:34.083
and it is this very bond that
 gives us lasting happiness.

62
00:03:38.833 --> 00:03:41.583
In your life, you must have

63
00:03:41.583 --> 00:03:45.666
watched a play at some point.

64
00:03:45.666 --> 00:03:48.291
What happens in a play?

65
00:03:48.291 --> 00:03:52.750
The play starts when curtain rises –

66
00:03:52.750 --> 00:03:54.166
scenes change,

67
00:03:54.166 --> 00:03:56.208
characters come and go,

68
00:03:56.208 --> 00:03:59.041
and finally the curtain falls

69
00:03:59.041 --> 00:04:01.333
and the play ends.

70
00:04:01.333 --> 00:04:07.041
But the stage remains exactly as it is,
 unchanged and unmoved.

71
00:04:07.041 --> 00:04:09.708
May be that is why people say –

72
00:04:09.708 --> 00:04:13.583
we are all puppets on this stage,

73
00:04:13.583 --> 00:04:17.083
and the strings are held by the one above.

74
00:04:17.083 --> 00:04:18.250
Now that,

75
00:04:18.250 --> 00:04:22.166
the strings of your life are in My hands,

76
00:04:22.166 --> 00:04:24.708
I want to share with you

77
00:04:24.708 --> 00:04:27.666
a profound truth of life.

78
00:04:27.666 --> 00:04:30.958
I want you to deeply understand this vast cycle

79
00:04:30.958 --> 00:04:35.833
of the creation and destruction of the universe.

80
00:04:35.833 --> 00:04:39.083
Just as these cosmic waves of beginning 

81
00:04:39.083 --> 00:04:43.000
and end keep moving through this world, 

82
00:04:43.000 --> 00:04:47.833
your life too is constantly changing.

83
00:04:47.833 --> 00:04:50.916
No success here is permanent.

84
00:04:50.916 --> 00:04:53.541
No failure is final.

85
00:04:53.541 --> 00:04:57.458
Honour and insult, joy and sorrow –
all of these are temporary.

86
00:04:57.458 --> 00:04:58.583
Remember –

87
00:04:58.583 --> 00:05:01.416
this world is always changing.

88
00:05:01.416 --> 00:05:03.833
What exists today will not be here tomorrow.

89
00:05:03.833 --> 00:05:08.250
And what comes tomorrow will
 not last forever either.

90
00:05:08.250 --> 00:05:11.500
When success comes, enjoy it –

91
00:05:11.500 --> 00:05:15.958
but do not let it breed pride.

92
00:05:15.958 --> 00:05:21.041
When failure comes, do not 
be fearful or anxious –

93
00:05:21.041 --> 00:05:23.208
learn from it.

94
00:05:23.208 --> 00:05:27.041
It is like a guide for you.

95
00:05:27.041 --> 00:05:28.250
Material success

96
00:05:28.250 --> 00:05:31.250
and failure are like the high waves of the ocean –

97
00:05:31.250 --> 00:05:34.166
momentary and full of excitement.

98
00:05:34.166 --> 00:05:35.541
But

99
00:05:35.541 --> 00:05:39.875
your connection with Me is like the ocean itself –

100
00:05:39.875 --> 00:05:42.708
unmoving and steady.

101
00:05:42.708 --> 00:05:46.083
So do not take this temporary world

102
00:05:46.083 --> 00:05:48.625
too seriously.

103
00:05:48.625 --> 00:05:51.208
Walk the spiritual path

104
00:05:51.208 --> 00:05:54.000
that lifts your soul,

105
00:05:54.000 --> 00:05:57.958
and establish

106
00:05:57.958 --> 00:06:01.166
your bond with Me.

107
00:06:01.166 --> 00:06:04.083
After that, you will find

108
00:06:04.083 --> 00:06:08.291
that even through the ups and downs of life,

109
00:06:08.291 --> 00:06:13.041
you experience balance and peace.

110
00:06:13.041 --> 00:06:17.250
Just try this for once.

111
00:06:22.000 --> 00:06:25.541
In a family,

112
00:06:25.541 --> 00:06:29.875
love and deep bonds are essential.

113
00:06:29.875 --> 00:06:31.166
Love is the thread

114
00:06:31.166 --> 00:06:36.875
that holds all family members together.

115
00:06:36.875 --> 00:06:41.125
But I want to share a truth with you.

116
00:06:41.125 --> 00:06:44.208
No matter how loving

117
00:06:44.208 --> 00:06:47.750
and deep a relationship may be –

118
00:06:47.750 --> 00:06:50.791
it does not last forever.

119
00:06:50.791 --> 00:06:52.458
Its end is certain.

120
00:06:52.458 --> 00:06:56.333
Just as the waves of the ocean rise

121
00:06:56.333 --> 00:06:58.583
and then dissolve,

122
00:06:58.583 --> 00:07:02.291
life connects us with our loved ones

123
00:07:02.291 --> 00:07:04.166
and then, with time,

124
00:07:04.166 --> 00:07:08.125
separates us from them.

125
00:07:08.125 --> 00:07:12.541
Do not be saddened by this truth.

126
00:07:12.541 --> 00:07:16.166
Instead, take it as a divine message.

127
00:07:16.166 --> 00:07:18.291
Use the time you have

128
00:07:18.291 --> 00:07:20.500
to be with your loved ones.

129
00:07:20.500 --> 00:07:23.166
Fill it with love.

130
00:07:23.166 --> 00:07:27.333
Do not get entangled in the fleeting
 attachments of this material world.

131
00:07:27.333 --> 00:07:30.375
Instead, inspire each other

132
00:07:30.375 --> 00:07:31.916
toward inner growth.

133
00:07:31.916 --> 00:07:35.333
Converse wholeheartedly with your loved ones.

134
00:07:35.333 --> 00:07:38.708
Reflect on life’s true purpose.

135
00:07:38.708 --> 00:07:43.458
Strengthen your bonds not
 just on a worldly level,

136
00:07:43.458 --> 00:07:46.666
but on a spiritual one too.

137
00:07:46.666 --> 00:07:48.916
Inspire your family members

138
00:07:48.916 --> 00:07:52.166
to build their own connection with Me,

139
00:07:52.166 --> 00:07:55.583
so that their lives too may be filled with joy,

140
00:07:55.583 --> 00:07:58.041
and they too may experience

141
00:07:58.041 --> 00:08:01.041
the glory of an eternal bond.

142
00:08:01.041 --> 00:08:03.625
When you focus on the eternal

143
00:08:03.625 --> 00:08:05.875
rather than the temporary,

144
00:08:05.875 --> 00:08:10.041
your bond with each other

145
00:08:10.041 --> 00:08:12.000
becomes even sweeter and more divine.

146
00:08:16.791 --> 00:08:18.625
At the workplace,

147
00:08:18.625 --> 00:08:22.041
the game of success and failure goes on.

148
00:08:22.041 --> 00:08:24.416
Sometimes projects are completed,

149
00:08:24.416 --> 00:08:25.833
sometimes they are not.

150
00:08:25.833 --> 00:08:27.833
Sometimes goals are achieved,

151
00:08:27.833 --> 00:08:29.416
sometimes they are not.

152
00:08:29.416 --> 00:08:31.583
Problems come and go.

153
00:08:31.583 --> 00:08:33.291
Just as the cycle of creation

154
00:08:33.291 --> 00:08:36.791
and dissolution continues in this universe,

155
00:08:36.791 --> 00:08:39.916
in the same way, a cycle of highs and lows

156
00:08:39.916 --> 00:08:42.833
continues in your professional 
life too. And this is life.

157
00:08:42.833 --> 00:08:44.666
But I say to you –

158
00:08:44.666 --> 00:08:47.666
do not be shaken by these changes.

159
00:08:47.666 --> 00:08:50.916
In such situations, remain steady.

160
00:08:50.916 --> 00:08:53.875
But steadiness does not mean

161
00:08:53.875 --> 00:08:56.833
turning away from your duties.

162
00:08:56.833 --> 00:08:58.250
It means

163
00:08:58.250 --> 00:09:00.750
not being disheartened by failure

164
00:09:00.750 --> 00:09:03.875
and not becoming arrogant with success.

165
00:09:03.875 --> 00:09:06.791
If your work succeeds,

166
00:09:06.791 --> 00:09:08.500
stay humble –

167
00:09:08.500 --> 00:09:11.166
do not get swept up in self-admiration.

168
00:09:11.166 --> 00:09:14.208
And if a plan fails,

169
00:09:14.208 --> 00:09:17.583
do not sink into despair – learn from it

170
00:09:17.583 --> 00:09:18.666
and move forward.

171
00:09:18.666 --> 00:09:22.500
When you understand that 
all of this is temporary,

172
00:09:22.500 --> 00:09:26.208
you will find yourself doing your
 work with even greater efficiency,

173
00:09:26.208 --> 00:09:29.583
focus, and freedom from stress.

174
00:09:29.583 --> 00:09:33.416
Give only your very best effort.

175
00:09:33.416 --> 00:09:34.041
But

176
00:09:34.041 --> 00:09:35.583
do not make your peace of mind

177
00:09:35.583 --> 00:09:38.083
dependent on results.

178
00:09:38.083 --> 00:09:40.166
Simply act –

179
00:09:40.166 --> 00:09:42.666
free from anxiety over outcomes.

180
00:09:42.666 --> 00:09:45.500
When you adopt this outlook,

181
00:09:45.500 --> 00:09:48.666
you not only move forward in your field,

182
00:09:48.666 --> 00:09:52.500
but also remain mentally calm

183
00:09:52.500 --> 00:09:53.833
and strong.

184
00:09:53.833 --> 00:09:57.000
This is the path to your lasting happiness.
